Week 2: Data Wrangler — Ops Sensor Log Deep-Dive
Dataset: ops_sensor_log_dirty.csv — one week (25 Jun – 1 Jul 2026) of simulated sensor telemetry (Pressure, Temperature, Flow Rate) from a fictional processing plant, logged every 2 minutes across 5 zones and 3 shifts.

This notebook covers:

Ingestion & Profiling — Data Health Report
Cleaning Pipeline — clean_ops_data()
Time-Series Analysis — hourly resampling + 24h rolling average
Aggregation — Shift x Zone summary tables
Visualization — Raw vs. Cleaned trend
