Bonus: where do the sensor faults cluster?
The Shift/Zone summary tables above look almost identical to each other because the fault readings were already stripped out during cleaning — operations are genuinely stable across every shift and zone. The more useful operational question is: where do the fault/dropout events themselves concentrate, since that points at which sensors need physical maintenance.


